<|startoftranscript|><|en|><|transcribe|><|0.00|> The fireball, half of it white, half azure blue, and the size of a ten-inch shell, move slowly about the raft, but revolving on its own axis with astonishing velocity, as if whipped round by the force of the whirlwind.<|14.08|>

